batten\-policy\-test \- Run each registered module\*(Aqs own `test_` rules and report the predicates none exercised
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten policy test\fR [\fB\-J\fR|\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
